Cell["\<\
A vector (rank-1) becomes a diagram with one output: A matrix (rank-2) \
becomes a diagram with one input and one output: Symbolic arrays lift \
directly: Contracted tensor expressions become composite diagrams:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4a57bbac-8a5c-4320-b55f-15967ff1f730"],

